A type that carries additional constraints beyond the base type, such as \"positive integers\" or \"non-null strings\". Enables more precise specifications and stronger compile-time guarantees.

A type that carries additional constraints beyond the base type, such as "positive integers" or "non-null strings". Enables more precise specifications and stronger compile-time guarantees.
